#: desktop.cc:667
msgid ""
"Could not logout properly.\n"
"The session manager cannot be contacted. You can try to force a shutdown by "
"pressing the CTRL, ALT and BACKSPACE keys at the same time. Note however "
"that your current session will not be saved with a forced shutdown."
msgstr ""
"Nije se moguće odjaviti!\n"
"Ne mogu pristupiti upravitelju sesija. Možete probati nasilno ugasiti "
"računar pritiskom na tipke CTRL, ATL i BACKSPACE istovremeno. Ipak, "
"obratite pažnju da vaša trenutna sesija u tom slučaju neće biti "
"snimljena."

